msgid "The success of this course depends heavily on the support provided to participants from GBIF's network of capacity enhancement mentors.  Visit the GBIF page on https://www.gbif.org/mentors[capacity enhancement mentoring^] to read more about these individuals and their contributions."
msgstr "本課程之成功，有賴於 GBIF 能力培育導師網絡對學員的全力支持。歡迎造訪 GBIF 官方網頁：https://www.gbif.org/mentors[capacity enhancement mentoring^] 進一步了解這些導師與他們的重要貢獻。"

