#. type: Plain text
#: en/epn/modules/ROOT/pages/acknowledgements.adoc:7
msgid "The course was first designed by an international group of node managers, with support from the GBIF Secretariat, as part of the Biodiversity Information for Development (BID) programme. https://www.gbif.org/programme/82243[BID^] is a multi-year programme funded by the European Union and led by the Global Biodiversity Information Facility (GBIF) with the aim of increasing the amount of biodiversity information available for use in scientific research and policymaking."
msgstr "本課程最初由一個國際節點管理員團隊在 GBIF 秘書處的支持下設計，作為「生物多樣性資訊促進發展」（BID）計畫的一部分。 「生物多樣性資訊促進發展」（https://www.gbif.org/programme/82243，簡稱BID^）是一項由歐盟資助、全球生物多樣性資訊設施（GBIF）主導的多年期計畫，旨在增加可供科學研究及政策制定使用的生物多樣性資訊數量。"

#. type: Block title
#: en/epn/modules/ROOT/pages/acknowledgements.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Meeting of the original trainers for this course, Copenhagen, 2019."
msgstr "本課程原班培訓人員會議，哥本哈根，2019年。"

